WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.340 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 30]

01:39.020 --> 01:40.900
[He-Yu Clinic]

01:46.590 --> 01:48.050
What's this new business about?

02:04.640 --> 02:06.380
[He-Yu Clinic]
The branch of He-Yu Clinic in Tianqi

02:06.590 --> 02:09.730
is officially open today!

02:11.640 --> 02:12.430
It's a clinic.

02:12.430 --> 02:13.430
Let's head home.

02:14.060 --> 02:15.740
- I need to make your father dinner. - Let's go.

02:15.740 --> 02:16.290
Come.

02:16.290 --> 02:17.630
- Please check this out. - Let me have a look.

02:21.520 --> 02:22.660
We should've asked Su Changhe

02:22.680 --> 02:23.540
to get us some shills.

02:24.150 --> 02:26.500
Tianqi City is both happening and prosperous.

02:27.560 --> 02:28.260
Why aren't these passersby

02:28.290 --> 02:29.730
visiting our clinic?

02:31.470 --> 02:32.660
It's probably because there are

02:32.680 --> 02:33.690
way too many clinics here.

02:34.470 --> 02:35.500
Unlike a tavern,

02:36.430 --> 02:37.220
these people wouldn't

02:37.240 --> 02:38.690
visit a newly opened clinic for fun.

02:39.520 --> 02:40.820
Once it's gained its reputation,

02:41.520 --> 02:43.060
many will come and seek our service.

02:44.240 --> 02:45.450
Yet it takes a very long time

02:45.870 --> 02:47.100
to gain popularity.

02:47.590 --> 02:48.450
It took us a lot

02:48.470 --> 02:50.220
to make that happen in Nan'an City.

02:50.750 --> 02:51.540
And now

02:52.030 --> 02:52.890
we're all the way here

02:52.960 --> 02:54.890
in Tianqi City.

02:55.960 --> 02:56.540
It's all right.

02:56.840 --> 02:57.450
Master.

02:57.870 --> 02:59.890
After this,

03:00.280 --> 03:02.110
we will build a clinic

03:02.110 --> 03:02.850
in each of the Four Greatest Cities,

03:03.030 --> 03:03.820
including Tianqi City,

03:04.220 --> 03:04.940
Xueyue City,

03:05.190 --> 03:06.130
Wushuang City,

03:06.430 --> 03:07.260
and Muliang City.

03:07.470 --> 03:09.890
There'll be branches of He-Yu Clinic all over.

03:10.360 --> 03:11.980
With Medicine King Valley's name on it,

03:12.240 --> 03:12.780
I guarantee

03:12.910 --> 03:14.610
we'll be the top clinic in the world.

03:15.800 --> 03:16.570
By then,

03:16.710 --> 03:17.820
even our founder

03:18.120 --> 03:19.260
would rise from his ashes,

03:19.280 --> 03:20.410
laughing in delight.

03:22.190 --> 03:23.500
But the Medicine King Valley's creed

03:23.590 --> 03:25.130
is to heal the sick.

03:25.560 --> 03:26.340
We save lives

03:26.870 --> 03:27.890
without expecting money in return.

03:28.750 --> 03:29.410
Well,

03:29.960 --> 03:30.890
instead of laughing,

03:31.630 --> 03:32.820
he'd wake up furious.

03:34.470 --> 03:35.260
Master.

03:36.000 --> 03:36.820
If so,

03:37.190 --> 03:38.130
when I become King of Medicine,

03:38.710 --> 03:39.820
I'll change that rule.

03:40.430 --> 03:41.450
You want to be the King of Medicine?

03:42.520 --> 03:43.850
You sure are bolder than me.

03:44.630 --> 03:45.220
Master.

03:45.560 --> 03:46.290
Think about it.

03:46.590 --> 03:47.610
Senior Brother Xin

03:47.750 --> 03:48.850
has no disciples.

03:49.150 --> 03:49.690
That makes me

03:50.000 --> 03:50.940
the only heir

03:51.030 --> 03:51.780
of Medicine King Valley.

03:52.630 --> 03:53.410
Well,

03:53.960 --> 03:55.010
naturally, I'll be King of Medicine.

03:55.960 --> 03:56.570
How ambitious of you!

03:56.840 --> 03:57.980
As expected of Su Muyu's sister.

03:58.360 --> 03:58.940
Su Muyu.

03:59.360 --> 04:00.780
Your sister wants to become King of Medicine.

04:01.360 --> 04:02.010
Well,

04:02.190 --> 04:03.060
what will you be?

04:05.520 --> 04:07.010
When Zhaoyan becomes King of Medicine

04:07.560 --> 04:09.450
and the clinic prospers,

04:10.000 --> 04:11.290
naturally, I'll be...

04:13.190 --> 04:13.780
the boss.

04:16.720 --> 04:18.580
You really do go with the flow.

04:19.190 --> 04:20.050
Exactly.

04:20.390 --> 04:21.020
Yu.

04:21.480 --> 04:22.490
If you're the boss...

04:26.000 --> 04:26.900
Master.

04:27.680 --> 04:30.540
Who'll be

04:30.680 --> 04:32.100
the boss's wife?

04:34.830 --> 04:35.730
My goodness! You...

04:35.800 --> 04:37.730
- You must've picked that up from Su Changhe! - Master!

04:37.920 --> 04:38.810
I've caught you red-handed!

04:39.000 --> 04:40.540
- Master, you're mad because you're embarrassed! - Stop right there!

04:40.560 --> 04:41.290
Help, Yu!

04:41.310 --> 04:42.700
- Help! - Miss Bai is right.

04:43.070 --> 04:43.930
You've gone astray.

04:44.390 --> 04:45.220
Your master should

04:45.270 --> 04:46.610
teach you a good lesson.

04:47.190 --> 04:47.810
Mr. Su.

04:48.000 --> 04:49.290
Watch your tongue!

04:49.980 --> 04:50.810
Second Master Tu.

04:53.070 --> 04:54.850
Congratulations on the opening.

04:57.270 --> 04:58.050
Many thanks, Second Master Tu.

05:01.120 --> 05:01.540
Zhaoyan.

05:01.630 --> 05:02.540
Bring the gifts inside.

05:03.070 --> 05:03.490
Otherwise,

05:03.560 --> 05:04.340
Su Muyu might have them

05:04.360 --> 05:05.340
returned.

05:06.040 --> 05:06.540
Yes, Master.

05:06.630 --> 05:07.980
You did us a big favor

05:08.120 --> 05:09.140
by helping us rent this place.

05:09.510 --> 05:10.220
As for the gifts...

05:10.240 --> 05:10.810
Well...

05:10.950 --> 05:12.250
I'll take them inside now.

05:21.510 --> 05:22.020
That's my sister,

05:22.190 --> 05:22.810
Xiao Zhaoyan.

05:24.800 --> 05:25.460
Her surname's Xiao?

05:26.240 --> 05:27.540
That's an influential surname

05:27.600 --> 05:29.050
here in Tianqi City.

05:30.360 --> 05:32.220
Zhaoyan's never been to Tianqi City.

05:32.560 --> 05:33.700
She's not of the royal line.

05:34.480 --> 05:35.370
Ah, I see.

05:37.430 --> 05:38.140
Second Master.

05:38.600 --> 05:39.100
Well,

05:39.310 --> 05:40.540
your steps are light

05:40.920 --> 05:41.780
and your face pale.

05:42.070 --> 05:42.660
How about

05:43.190 --> 05:44.410
I take your pulse?

05:44.950 --> 05:46.410
You're our first customer,

05:46.750 --> 05:47.980
so no consultation fee.

05:48.630 --> 05:49.540
Nonsense!

05:49.750 --> 05:51.020
I'm perfectly healthy!

05:51.310 --> 05:52.170
Is that so?

05:53.000 --> 05:53.930
Don't

05:54.040 --> 05:55.660
your hands and feet

05:55.830 --> 05:56.810
feel cold?

05:57.270 --> 05:58.540
Especially at night

05:58.680 --> 06:00.460
when your body is so cold, as if you're lying in ice.

06:01.040 --> 06:02.410
I practice Frost Qi.

06:02.720 --> 06:04.050
It's normal for my body to feel a bit cold.

06:05.510 --> 06:09.220
Then why the sweating hands and feet

06:09.390 --> 06:10.930
and sleepless nights?

06:16.270 --> 06:16.780
Miss Bai.

06:17.310 --> 06:17.930
Please take a look.

06:25.120 --> 06:25.660
Miss Bai.

06:26.390 --> 06:27.050
Well,

06:27.750 --> 06:28.810
are my days numbered?

06:30.070 --> 06:30.660
The root of Qi

06:31.310 --> 06:32.020
lies in the kidneys.

06:32.390 --> 06:33.220
And it goes back there.

06:33.830 --> 06:34.340
It's said,

06:34.630 --> 06:35.810
"The kidneys draw in Qi.

06:36.430 --> 06:38.340
Your breath runs deep."

06:38.720 --> 06:40.610
What... What does that mean?

06:41.360 --> 06:41.980
Second Master Tu.

06:42.310 --> 06:43.370
What my master means

06:43.720 --> 06:44.490
is you have weak kidneys,

06:44.720 --> 06:45.610
and you need to replenish your Qi.

06:46.870 --> 06:48.370
Nonsense, Miss Bai!

06:48.680 --> 06:50.100
You're talking nonsense!

06:50.480 --> 06:52.370
All I do every day is listen to music.

06:52.630 --> 06:53.730
How could that weaken my kidneys?

06:55.830 --> 06:57.020
Do hear her out.

06:57.750 --> 06:59.050
When yang energy weakens down below,

06:59.310 --> 07:00.220
it causes cold stagnation.

07:00.600 --> 07:01.900
When yin energy weakens down below,

07:02.360 --> 07:03.140
it causes heat stagnation.

07:03.750 --> 07:05.140
I don't get it, Miss Bai.

07:06.000 --> 07:06.730
It means

07:07.000 --> 07:08.370
there are two kinds of kidney deficiency,

07:09.000 --> 07:09.490
which are yin deficiency

07:09.920 --> 07:10.660
and yang deficiency.

07:11.390 --> 07:12.340
Then which kind is mine?

07:14.430 --> 07:15.490
Both of them.

07:16.480 --> 07:16.900
I'm doomed.

07:17.560 --> 07:18.660
I shouldn't have rushed it

07:18.680 --> 07:19.610
for the past two years.

07:20.600 --> 07:21.460
It's a minor illness.

07:21.680 --> 07:22.930
With Miss Bai around,

07:23.070 --> 07:24.020
you'll recover instantly.

07:25.310 --> 07:26.050
Well,

07:26.510 --> 07:27.930
who knew listening to music daily

07:28.630 --> 07:29.700
could cause this kind of problem?

07:31.870 --> 07:32.580
Who are you?

07:33.480 --> 07:34.410
I'm Su Changhe.

07:36.600 --> 07:38.810
You're the Patriarch of Blood River.

07:38.920 --> 07:39.730
Pardon me for my rudeness.

07:39.870 --> 07:40.580
I'm Tu Wan,
[*Wan as in late]

07:40.720 --> 07:42.170
and I'm a friend of Master Su.

07:42.800 --> 07:43.410
What a nice name.

07:43.600 --> 07:44.540
Is

07:44.750 --> 07:45.460
Master Tu Zao
[*Zao as in early]

07:45.830 --> 07:46.780
your elder brother?

07:47.310 --> 07:48.050
Indeed.

07:48.430 --> 07:49.540
Our late father used to urge us

07:49.630 --> 07:51.490
to act fast when it comes to great deeds.

07:51.680 --> 07:52.660
So when my brother was born,

07:52.680 --> 07:53.900
he was named Tu Zao.

07:54.240 --> 07:55.370
My brother lived up to his name

07:55.630 --> 07:56.410
and got famous at a young age.

07:56.720 --> 07:57.540
At just eleven,

07:57.630 --> 07:59.050
he killed a thug

07:59.160 --> 07:59.700
bullying our family.

07:59.870 --> 08:01.020
He then spent five years in prison.

08:01.480 --> 08:02.170
From then on,

08:02.190 --> 08:03.050
our father decided

08:03.360 --> 08:04.810
it's better to succeed late than early.

08:05.120 --> 08:05.980
So when I was born,

08:06.070 --> 08:06.930
he named me Tu Wan.

08:09.120 --> 08:09.730
Interesting.

08:10.560 --> 08:11.410
Still, I didn't expect

08:11.430 --> 08:12.370
the quiet and reserved

08:12.560 --> 08:13.810
Master Su

08:13.830 --> 08:15.250
to have friends everywhere.

08:18.000 --> 08:19.410
Do stay for lunch.

08:21.070 --> 08:21.610
It's all right.

08:21.870 --> 08:23.250
Things are busy at Thousand-Gold Tower,

08:23.270 --> 08:24.050
so I shouldn't stay for long.

08:24.120 --> 08:25.930
I'll take my leave first.

08:26.600 --> 08:27.220
Wait.

08:34.080 --> 08:34.820
Thank you, Miss Bai.

08:36.360 --> 08:38.460
Su, Patriarch, I'll excuse myself.

08:40.910 --> 08:41.850
Second Master, I'll see you out.

08:43.600 --> 08:45.130
Has he tried your cooking too?

08:45.550 --> 08:47.180
Why'd he run the moment you invited him

08:47.440 --> 08:48.130
to stay for lunch?

08:49.030 --> 08:50.460
He must've recognized who you are

08:50.750 --> 08:51.460
and got scared off.

08:56.550 --> 08:58.100
When I was an undertaker,

08:59.030 --> 08:59.770
I felt delighted

08:59.790 --> 09:00.730
when someone

09:00.750 --> 09:01.490
became terrified

09:02.320 --> 09:03.180
at the mention of my name.

09:04.510 --> 09:05.460
But now

09:06.790 --> 09:07.730
I feel otherwise.

09:13.440 --> 09:13.940
Muyu.

09:15.000 --> 09:15.980
Does this mean

09:17.240 --> 09:18.820
I'm becoming a good person?

09:19.550 --> 09:21.130
Who said you were a bad one?

09:21.720 --> 09:22.420
Miss Bai.

09:23.840 --> 09:24.770
She says that all the time.

09:26.200 --> 09:26.580
Well,

09:27.360 --> 09:28.460
I call you

09:29.270 --> 09:30.460
a wicked thing.

09:31.000 --> 09:32.100
Oh, really?

09:32.150 --> 09:33.650
So I'm not even human now?

09:34.150 --> 09:35.220
Hell Palm!

09:36.480 --> 09:37.300
What are you trying to do?

09:38.720 --> 09:39.460
Your Hell Palm

09:39.960 --> 09:40.940
is almost at its ninth level.

09:43.630 --> 09:44.130
Yes.

09:44.870 --> 09:45.730
It's almost there.

09:46.390 --> 09:47.980
It's nearly as strong as Mu Ciling back then.

09:48.550 --> 09:49.250
However,

09:49.600 --> 09:50.980
I need to find time for seclusion

09:51.030 --> 09:52.060
and break through the ninth level soon.

09:52.960 --> 09:54.490
If not, with so many experts in Tianqi City,

09:55.670 --> 09:56.490
it'll be trouble.

09:57.240 --> 09:58.010
Su Muyu.

09:58.550 --> 09:59.700
I've always wondered

10:00.270 --> 10:01.700
who is stronger.

10:02.000 --> 10:03.700
You or Su Changhe?

10:04.240 --> 10:04.890
Naturally,

10:05.440 --> 10:06.250
it's Yu.

10:07.790 --> 10:08.490
Really?

10:10.360 --> 10:11.220
Who is the Patriarch here?

10:11.240 --> 10:12.340
Me or him?

10:12.840 --> 10:13.420
It's you.

10:13.600 --> 10:14.820
Then naturally, I'm stronger.

10:15.480 --> 10:16.420
As Master said,

10:17.000 --> 10:17.980
if it were a normal duel,

10:18.670 --> 10:19.980
I'd have a ninety percent chance of winning.

10:20.480 --> 10:21.580
But if it came down to life and death,

10:22.080 --> 10:23.010
Changhe's chance of winning

10:23.840 --> 10:24.610
would be a hundred percent.

10:25.790 --> 10:27.060
Who was your master?

10:27.480 --> 10:28.890
I've never heard of her.

10:29.630 --> 10:31.490
Our master forbade us from mentioning her name.

10:32.360 --> 10:33.060
But it doesn't matter.

10:33.600 --> 10:34.370
What matters is what she said.

10:35.030 --> 10:36.340
I understand what she meant.

10:37.270 --> 10:39.130
She meant that Su Changhe

10:39.550 --> 10:41.010
fights without holding back,

10:41.600 --> 10:42.580
while Su Muyu

10:42.960 --> 10:44.300
is always merciful.

10:45.320 --> 10:45.940
That's why

10:46.360 --> 10:47.700
Su Muyu's bound to die.

10:49.550 --> 10:50.100
Why?

10:51.320 --> 10:52.340
If there comes a day

10:52.670 --> 10:54.100
when Su Muyu kills me with a single strike,

10:54.670 --> 10:55.700
it could be because

10:55.720 --> 10:56.580
I can't bring myself to kill him, no?

10:57.200 --> 10:58.340
Didn't our master

10:58.550 --> 10:59.460
say that too?

11:01.360 --> 11:02.060
What did she say?

11:04.390 --> 11:05.180
That's not important.

11:06.270 --> 11:07.940
Today marks the opening of He-Yu Clinic,

11:08.120 --> 11:09.060
so I've got you a grand gift.

11:10.480 --> 11:12.370
Don't tell me it's another ancestral jade basin?

11:12.960 --> 11:13.850
Calling us basins?

11:14.320 --> 11:15.890
That's rather rude of you, Miss Bai.

11:16.150 --> 11:16.940
Master Mu.

11:17.440 --> 11:18.100
Miss Xuewei.

11:18.270 --> 11:19.340
You're here in Tianqi City too?

11:21.630 --> 11:22.340
Xuewei was full of deadly poison.

11:22.360 --> 11:23.300
After it was purged,

11:23.320 --> 11:24.650
she went back to the Blood River for a few days of rest.

11:25.080 --> 11:25.890
Since she's fine now,

11:26.270 --> 11:27.220
she's here to help you out.

11:27.960 --> 11:29.370
But I'm no longer the Poisonous Blossom.

11:29.870 --> 11:31.220
Can I still be of any use?

11:32.080 --> 11:33.250
I'd say probably not.

11:34.000 --> 11:35.220
Yet according to Qingyang,

11:35.360 --> 11:36.370
your mastery of formations

11:36.390 --> 11:37.300
rivals your poisoning technique.

11:39.320 --> 11:40.060
Formations?

11:40.320 --> 11:41.530
I know nothing about them.

11:43.240 --> 11:44.060
Patriarch,

11:44.120 --> 11:45.370
you must've misheard me.

11:45.600 --> 11:47.370
I said I could set formations.

11:47.910 --> 11:48.460
Although

11:48.670 --> 11:50.220
Xuewei has got rid of all the poisons,

11:50.510 --> 11:50.940
she

11:51.120 --> 11:51.980
remains the foremost poison expert

11:52.000 --> 11:52.820
in the Mu family.

11:53.270 --> 11:53.980
Her poisoning technique

11:54.320 --> 11:55.220
and my formations

11:55.630 --> 11:56.490
will make for

11:56.720 --> 11:57.580
the perfect gift for Miss Bai.

12:00.080 --> 12:00.580
Therefore,

12:00.910 --> 12:01.730
no matter what,

12:02.030 --> 12:03.100
Miss Xuewei

12:03.320 --> 12:04.100
had to be here

12:04.120 --> 12:04.940
with you,

12:05.120 --> 12:05.770
right?

12:10.480 --> 12:11.530
The talented should work harder.

12:12.910 --> 12:14.250
Since we're not hiding our identities

12:14.670 --> 12:15.580
throughout this trip,

12:16.260 --> 12:17.360
naturally, some preparations are needed

12:17.600 --> 12:18.370
to make He-Yu Clinic

12:19.000 --> 12:20.180
our base here.

12:21.750 --> 12:22.220
I promised

12:22.960 --> 12:24.010
to gift Miss Bai a Spider's Nest.

12:24.630 --> 12:25.730
However, due to the tight schedule,

12:26.150 --> 12:27.250
I couldn't make that happen here.

12:27.630 --> 12:28.650
Still, we must do something.

12:29.720 --> 12:30.850
With Qingyang and Xuewei here,

12:31.030 --> 12:32.100
setting up formations

12:32.510 --> 12:33.730
shouldn't be an issue.

12:35.670 --> 12:37.180
This seems like a dangerous place to be.

12:37.510 --> 12:38.840
Nowhere feels safer

12:39.080 --> 12:39.890
than Nan'an City.

12:45.510 --> 12:46.490
Dreams of the martial world

12:47.200 --> 12:48.300
fade into the heart's stillness.

12:49.550 --> 12:51.180
The turmoil of the court

12:51.960 --> 12:53.130
seems but a fleeting dream.

12:56.480 --> 12:57.730
Are you being sentimental again?

12:57.960 --> 12:58.700
The word sentimental

12:58.720 --> 13:00.850
is used to describe a lovelorn couple.

13:01.440 --> 13:02.060
I'm just

13:02.720 --> 13:04.300
missing my younger self.

13:06.360 --> 13:08.180
Aren't you a lovelorn man?

13:08.600 --> 13:10.130
Then where did Ling Chen come from?

13:10.720 --> 13:11.730
And what about your Princess of Langya?

13:14.670 --> 13:15.580
Well...

13:16.480 --> 13:18.370
She has her own life to live.

13:21.240 --> 13:21.770
Right.

13:23.120 --> 13:24.180
She has her life,

13:24.390 --> 13:25.300
and you have yours.

13:26.120 --> 13:26.890
You should forget her

13:27.360 --> 13:28.940
and find yourself a new Princess of Langya.

13:30.480 --> 13:31.100
You know.

13:31.390 --> 13:32.530
It's all your fault.

13:34.000 --> 13:34.960
What does that have to do with me?

13:35.510 --> 13:37.220
If Lei Mengsha hadn't fallen for you back then

13:37.440 --> 13:38.250
and locked himself in the Sword Heart Tomb

13:38.270 --> 13:39.220
for months on end,

13:39.440 --> 13:40.700
I wouldn't have gotten worried

13:40.720 --> 13:41.460
and gone looking for him.

13:41.790 --> 13:42.610
And I wouldn't have

13:42.960 --> 13:44.300
met her out in the martial world.

13:45.630 --> 13:46.650
Why don't you blame Emperor Tai'an

13:46.720 --> 13:47.730
for giving birth to you, huh?

13:49.150 --> 13:50.580
Everything happens for a reason.

13:51.360 --> 13:52.220
Anyway, by my guess,

13:52.600 --> 13:54.180
she should be arriving soon.

13:56.670 --> 13:57.730
She's coming to Tianqi City?

14:03.000 --> 14:03.890
A sword that flies without edge

14:04.440 --> 14:05.250
only seeks reunion.

14:10.320 --> 14:11.130
She's really here.

14:12.670 --> 14:13.580
You invited her?

14:14.960 --> 14:16.300
You finally had the courage to see her.

14:19.120 --> 14:20.380
I even dared face

14:20.380 --> 14:21.180
Nanjue's mighty army.

14:21.750 --> 14:23.100
Why would I fear facing her?

14:24.030 --> 14:24.460
Are we

14:24.840 --> 14:26.300
meeting the Blood River tomorrow?

14:26.840 --> 14:27.770
Should we do it another day?

14:28.670 --> 14:29.340
No need.

14:29.670 --> 14:30.980
Canceling this first meeting

14:31.080 --> 14:32.420
would make us seem untrustworthy.

14:34.360 --> 14:34.980
You entertain them first.

14:35.360 --> 14:35.940
I'll join you after that.

14:36.870 --> 14:37.530
Sure.

14:49.740 --> 14:52.180
[Situ Xue]

15:00.630 --> 15:02.420
The glow of sunset reflects on the lake's ripples.

15:03.120 --> 15:04.300
No small boat can cross it.

15:04.790 --> 15:05.610
Only the one in my dreams can.

15:08.750 --> 15:09.490
Your poetry

15:09.870 --> 15:11.220
is even worse than it used to be,

15:11.750 --> 15:12.730
Your Highness.

15:15.440 --> 15:17.060
But I really did try my best

15:17.720 --> 15:19.180
to dress just like I did back then.

15:20.030 --> 15:21.420
That's the difference between us.

15:25.510 --> 15:26.700
You try hard to look like before,

15:28.150 --> 15:28.770
but I am

15:30.670 --> 15:31.580
still the same as before.

15:34.080 --> 15:34.580
No.

15:35.120 --> 15:35.730
You're more...

15:35.750 --> 15:36.300
Stop.

15:37.150 --> 15:38.480
Don't you dare say I'm more beautiful now.

15:38.480 --> 15:39.180
That's a terrible line.

15:43.480 --> 15:44.890
I'm either in court

15:45.320 --> 15:46.340
or on the battlefield these days.

15:46.870 --> 15:47.580
I rarely get the chance

15:47.960 --> 15:48.980
to say such horrible lines.

15:56.550 --> 15:57.250
You still

15:58.270 --> 15:59.460
have the Haoque Sword with you, no?

16:01.550 --> 16:02.300
Like I said.

16:03.240 --> 16:04.490
If you were a mere swordsman,

16:05.630 --> 16:07.130
you could say such things all the time.

16:17.200 --> 16:18.300
My master once told me

16:19.480 --> 16:21.060
that I'd only ever have one chance to choose.

16:23.550 --> 16:24.300
Well...

16:27.360 --> 16:28.580
You can always choose again.

16:41.000 --> 16:41.940
Then can I

16:43.000 --> 16:43.890
do so later?

16:47.750 --> 16:48.420
Tell me.

16:49.150 --> 16:50.250
Why did you suddenly send me the missive

16:50.630 --> 16:51.530
asking me to come to Tianqi City?

16:53.440 --> 16:54.730
Something might happen

16:55.510 --> 16:56.890
in Tianqi City soon.

16:58.080 --> 16:58.730
I thought

16:59.150 --> 17:00.060
I'd ask for your help.

17:00.750 --> 17:01.610
I'm a wanderer,

17:02.550 --> 17:03.490
so I don't meddle in court affairs.

17:04.000 --> 17:05.220
I told you that years ago.

17:05.920 --> 17:06.730
If I could have helped you,

17:07.400 --> 17:08.770
I wouldn't have left you back then.

17:10.480 --> 17:11.220
I hate this place.

17:12.400 --> 17:13.620
And I hate being tied

17:13.880 --> 17:14.810
to anything about it.

17:16.480 --> 17:17.290
But this time

17:18.000 --> 17:18.730
I might die.

17:26.270 --> 17:26.940
It's like what happened then.

17:28.270 --> 17:29.290
When you and your brother

17:29.640 --> 17:30.940
fought for the throne,

17:31.310 --> 17:32.220
you could've died any time.

17:34.830 --> 17:36.460
Yet I never once came to Tianqi City

17:36.680 --> 17:37.380
to see you.

17:39.720 --> 17:40.290
I know.

17:41.680 --> 17:42.380
It's just that,

17:43.000 --> 17:44.330
if I really am in danger,

17:45.680 --> 17:46.250
I hope

17:46.790 --> 17:48.050
you'll take Ling Chen away.

17:55.920 --> 17:57.660
It's exhausting

17:57.830 --> 17:58.570
to travel with a burden.

17:59.830 --> 18:00.730
You have so many friends.

18:02.880 --> 18:03.900
He has better options.

18:06.550 --> 18:07.700
He could go to Xueyue City

18:08.110 --> 18:09.700
and persuade the greatest Baili Dongjun

18:09.830 --> 18:10.660
to take him in.

18:11.790 --> 18:12.700
Or he could go to Sword Heart Tomb

18:13.440 --> 18:14.530
and become the next Sword Deity.

18:15.720 --> 18:16.900
He could even join the Tang Clan.

18:17.790 --> 18:18.860
I remember when he was little,

18:19.350 --> 18:20.010
he loved tinkering

18:20.030 --> 18:21.380
with bits and pieces.

18:22.200 --> 18:22.940
But you

18:24.200 --> 18:25.290
are his mother after all.

18:26.350 --> 18:27.290
Does our blood tie

18:28.240 --> 18:29.050
matter much?

18:31.000 --> 18:32.140
To me,

18:33.200 --> 18:34.180
it does.

18:42.640 --> 18:43.250
Forget it.

18:44.310 --> 18:45.050
If you die,

18:46.550 --> 18:48.010
I'll get him out of Tianqi City.

18:49.200 --> 18:50.180
Remember my condition.

18:51.160 --> 18:51.980
Only when you die

18:52.880 --> 18:53.810
will I take him.

19:01.590 --> 19:02.940
He won't avenge you.

19:03.590 --> 19:04.620
Like me,

19:04.920 --> 19:06.420
he'll be a carefree wanderer.

19:08.240 --> 19:08.940
That's perfect.

19:12.240 --> 19:13.010
How troublesome.

19:16.110 --> 19:17.530
I really regret listening to you

19:18.110 --> 19:18.860
and coming to Tianqi City

19:19.680 --> 19:20.620
to see you again.

19:48.680 --> 19:49.220
Miss.

19:52.790 --> 19:53.730
Who are you, scoundrel?

19:54.790 --> 19:55.410
Do you have a death wish?

19:55.480 --> 19:56.620
No... It hurts...

19:57.000 --> 19:58.730
I just wanted to ask for directions.

19:58.920 --> 19:59.700
Where to?

20:00.440 --> 20:01.460
To the Sword Heart Tomb.

20:05.200 --> 20:05.810
So you knew

20:05.830 --> 20:07.180
this is the entrance to Sword Heart Tomb?

20:10.720 --> 20:12.050
Looks like you're a guest here.

20:15.680 --> 20:16.620
What brings you here?

20:16.920 --> 20:17.570
Are you seeking a sword?

20:18.680 --> 20:19.660
No, I have my own sword here.

20:20.270 --> 20:21.770
My senior brother

20:22.030 --> 20:23.660
came here on some business.

20:23.960 --> 20:25.010
It's been months,

20:25.030 --> 20:25.700
but he hasn't returned.

20:26.110 --> 20:26.960
I grew worried,

20:27.160 --> 20:28.050
so I came to find him.

20:28.830 --> 20:31.250
May I take a look at your sword?

20:47.480 --> 20:49.050
I've never seen such a fine sword.

20:49.310 --> 20:50.180
I've never seen its like

20:50.240 --> 20:51.140
even at Sword Heart Tomb.

20:51.480 --> 20:52.420
What's the name of this sword?

20:52.790 --> 20:53.660
And where did you get it?

20:55.000 --> 20:55.700
It's called

20:56.640 --> 20:57.250
Autumn Thunder.

20:57.680 --> 20:58.380
It's a family heirloom of mine.

20:59.590 --> 21:00.730
Autumn Thunder...

21:02.960 --> 21:04.090
I've never heard of it.

21:04.720 --> 21:05.460
How skilled are you?

21:06.680 --> 21:07.380
I'm decent enough.

21:08.640 --> 21:09.290
Draw your sword on me.

21:10.030 --> 21:10.730
Why?

21:11.240 --> 21:12.220
Just do it.

21:12.480 --> 21:12.980
I'm not afraid.

21:13.480 --> 21:13.900
Come on.

21:24.960 --> 21:25.770
Golden Light Shield?

21:26.200 --> 21:27.250
You're from the Situ family?

21:27.750 --> 21:28.940
You're pretty knowledgeable,

21:29.070 --> 21:30.290
but you tend to dawdle.

21:30.920 --> 21:31.570
Do it already!

21:32.680 --> 21:33.250
Sure!

21:49.240 --> 21:49.810
Nice.

21:50.310 --> 21:51.010
What a fine sword.

21:51.400 --> 21:52.140
How strong its sword energy is.

21:56.880 --> 21:57.380
Miss!

22:05.780 --> 22:13.380
♪When we meet again, may our first glance be as it was before♪

22:13.420 --> 22:20.860
♪Ask not of joy or sorrow in this world, speak only of our heart's desire♪

22:20.860 --> 22:27.860
♪Hear the free wind's song, hear the snow fall upon my battle robes…♪

22:27.880 --> 22:28.530
Miss...

22:29.440 --> 22:30.180
Are you all right?

22:35.160 --> 22:36.160
That was a nice move.

22:36.480 --> 22:37.180
What's its name?

22:39.790 --> 22:40.700
It's known as

22:40.830 --> 22:41.460
The World's Third.

22:42.590 --> 22:43.730
That's an odd name.

22:44.110 --> 22:44.860
What does it mean?

22:45.960 --> 22:46.770
My master once claimed that,

22:47.270 --> 22:48.220
when it comes to swordsmanship,

22:48.550 --> 22:49.380
he is

22:50.000 --> 22:51.490
second to none.

22:51.920 --> 22:53.380
I admit I'll never surpass him.

22:53.960 --> 22:54.860
So I created this technique

22:55.160 --> 22:56.380
to rank just beneath my master.

22:56.680 --> 22:57.700
Hence, I named it The World's Third.

22:58.070 --> 22:58.810
Not bad.

22:59.200 --> 23:01.330
From now on, you'll be The World's Third.

23:01.720 --> 23:03.380
Your master will be The World's Second.

23:03.720 --> 23:04.250
And I

23:06.480 --> 23:07.380
am The World's Number One!

23:08.000 --> 23:08.490
Miss!

23:09.160 --> 23:10.000
Your sword's mine now!

23:10.110 --> 23:11.420
Come if you want it back!

23:12.270 --> 23:12.770
Miss!

23:46.070 --> 23:46.940
Take it back.

23:47.480 --> 23:48.250
You chased me for a whole day and night

23:48.310 --> 23:49.330
over this stupid sword.

23:53.750 --> 23:54.330
Miss.

23:55.000 --> 23:55.940
This sword is my family heirloom.

23:56.510 --> 23:57.570
I really can't give it away.

23:58.110 --> 23:59.050
Once I get to the Sword Heart Tomb,

23:59.440 --> 24:00.530
I'll get you a famous sword instead.

24:00.720 --> 24:01.250
What say you?

24:04.480 --> 24:05.010
Really?

24:05.480 --> 24:06.090
You're not lying to me?

24:10.590 --> 24:11.180
I am

24:11.750 --> 24:12.620
a man of my word.

24:16.270 --> 24:17.050
Look at me.

24:38.640 --> 24:39.490
It's so hot.

24:42.110 --> 24:42.980
Yes, it's kind of warm.

24:48.070 --> 24:49.050
I'm going to cool myself off.

24:50.000 --> 24:50.420
Miss!

25:38.510 --> 25:39.140
It's still hot.

25:40.030 --> 25:41.050
What should we do?

25:43.480 --> 25:44.140
Well,

25:44.240 --> 25:45.180
I've cooled down now.

25:49.110 --> 25:49.900
I have an idea.

25:50.880 --> 25:51.730
Let's get married.

25:55.000 --> 25:56.140
You'll marry into my family

25:56.920 --> 25:58.860
with the Autumn Thunder being your dowry.

25:59.440 --> 25:59.940
From now on,

26:00.440 --> 26:01.330
what's yours is mine.

26:02.110 --> 26:02.570
Miss.

26:02.920 --> 26:05.180
Are you trying to make me a live-in son-in-law?

26:07.200 --> 26:07.860
Why?

26:08.960 --> 26:09.810
Am I not pretty enough?

26:12.160 --> 26:13.050
What's your name?

26:14.680 --> 26:16.770
I'm Xiao Ruofeng.

26:18.830 --> 26:19.530
I'm Situ Xue.

26:23.550 --> 26:24.140
Oh, right.

26:24.750 --> 26:25.700
Why didn't you answer

26:26.000 --> 26:27.050
my first question?

26:29.880 --> 26:30.570
Am I

26:31.640 --> 26:32.380
not pretty?

26:33.960 --> 26:34.660
You're stunning.

26:38.550 --> 26:39.010
It's settled, then!

27:00.790 --> 27:01.330
Father.

27:01.680 --> 27:02.940
I've brought my husband home.

27:03.480 --> 27:04.180
Stop right there.

27:12.270 --> 27:13.660
What took you so long?

27:14.880 --> 27:16.250
After leaving the Sword Heart Tomb,

27:16.400 --> 27:17.330
we went to Guiyun Manor

27:17.550 --> 27:18.490
for the Liquor and Sword Gathering.

27:19.200 --> 27:20.220
And we even won first place.

27:20.920 --> 27:22.330
We then went to Mount Xingwang

27:22.480 --> 27:23.440
and destroyed the Lianhuo Stronghold.

27:23.680 --> 27:24.810
After that, we traveled back to Mount Qilei

27:24.920 --> 27:26.010
by home.

27:30.750 --> 27:31.940
That brat over there.

27:32.720 --> 27:34.090
Let me take a look

27:34.550 --> 27:35.620
at that sword in your hand.

27:37.400 --> 27:38.050
Sure.

27:43.720 --> 27:44.220
Father.

27:44.510 --> 27:45.770
That's his dowry.

27:46.000 --> 27:47.700
It belongs to me and him.

27:50.960 --> 27:52.530
It's the Haoque Sword.

27:54.270 --> 27:54.980
What?

27:57.400 --> 27:59.050
One of the ten legendary swords,

28:01.720 --> 28:02.570
the Haoque Sword?

28:04.920 --> 28:07.490
It truly is a fine sword.

28:09.200 --> 28:10.090
However,

28:10.790 --> 28:12.250
I'm afraid

28:13.270 --> 28:14.770
none of us in this family

28:15.070 --> 28:16.380
are able to wield it.

28:23.640 --> 28:24.290
Young man.

28:25.160 --> 28:26.290
What's your name?

28:29.000 --> 28:30.980
I am Xiao Ruofeng.

28:31.830 --> 28:32.530
As I thought.

28:33.680 --> 28:36.530
You're of the Xiao imperial line.

28:37.640 --> 28:38.490
Xue.

28:39.880 --> 28:40.860
Are you trying

28:40.920 --> 28:42.810
to bring a prince home?

28:54.030 --> 28:54.940
I don't blame you

28:55.550 --> 28:56.330
for keeping that from me.

28:57.480 --> 28:58.700
After all, we met by chance

28:58.790 --> 28:59.530
in the martial world.

28:59.880 --> 29:00.940
It was only natural for you

29:01.030 --> 29:01.810
to be cautious.

29:02.750 --> 29:04.050
But I'm a wanderer.

29:04.480 --> 29:06.140
And I hate everything about the court.

29:07.270 --> 29:07.940
So...

29:16.240 --> 29:17.290
I won't accept

29:20.750 --> 29:21.730
this sword.

30:46.750 --> 30:47.570
You're a prince,

30:48.240 --> 30:49.700
yet you came to Mount Qilei every month.

30:50.160 --> 30:50.810
Don't you have better things to do?

30:55.340 --> 30:56.240
[Tea]

30:56.240 --> 30:56.860
Waiter.

30:58.830 --> 30:59.330
Miss?

30:59.590 --> 31:00.440
A pot of Peach Blossom Liquor.

31:00.590 --> 31:01.050
Coming right up.

31:01.680 --> 31:02.290
Hold on.

31:03.640 --> 31:04.220
Sir?

31:08.440 --> 31:08.980
Make it two pots.

31:10.310 --> 31:10.730
Right away.

31:10.830 --> 31:11.420
Please wait a moment.

31:46.510 --> 31:47.140
You might catch a chill.

31:57.720 --> 31:59.140
Would you put down this umbrella

31:59.750 --> 32:00.730
and spend this winter day with me?

32:09.790 --> 32:10.380
Sure.

32:15.400 --> 32:16.940
I hate the court and its power struggle,

32:17.030 --> 32:17.860
but I don't hate you.

32:19.200 --> 32:20.050
What a nuisance.

32:23.640 --> 32:24.700
I'll be generous

32:25.240 --> 32:26.420
and allow you to visit me often.

32:26.960 --> 32:28.220
But if you ever become one of those

32:28.240 --> 32:29.250
scheming, power-hungry men

32:29.680 --> 32:30.460
who have no sense of righteousness,

32:31.880 --> 32:33.140
I'll stop being kind to you.

32:45.790 --> 32:46.490
Deal.

32:50.590 --> 32:51.660
You have one year.

32:52.680 --> 32:53.900
If you can stay in the martial world,

32:54.400 --> 32:56.090
then we'll roam the world together.

32:56.680 --> 32:58.380
But if you choose to return to the imperial city,

32:58.960 --> 32:59.570
then

33:00.550 --> 33:01.460
we part ways for good.

33:02.200 --> 33:04.090
Neither of us will be happy again.

34:18.360 --> 34:19.340
This is Su Muyu, head of the Su family.

34:20.000 --> 34:21.010
I bet you all know him well.

34:23.400 --> 34:24.060
This

34:24.150 --> 34:25.380
is Mu Qingyang, head of the Mu family.

34:26.000 --> 34:27.490
You must have met him many times, Guardian Azure Dragon.

34:30.510 --> 34:31.130
And this...

34:32.320 --> 34:32.820
Of course,

34:33.150 --> 34:34.420
she isn't the Xie family head.

34:35.190 --> 34:36.900
She's a dear friend and a sister in arms

34:36.920 --> 34:37.740
of the Blood River.

34:38.150 --> 34:39.610
She's Bai Hehuai, a miracle physician

34:39.630 --> 34:40.210
from Medicine King Valley.

34:41.150 --> 34:42.260
I'm Bai Hehuai of Medicine King Valley.

34:42.630 --> 34:43.860
Greetings, fellow Guardians.

34:44.480 --> 34:45.740
In terms of seniority,

34:45.880 --> 34:46.650
you're the most senior

34:46.800 --> 34:47.690
among us.

34:48.070 --> 34:48.900
So just spare the formalities.

34:49.920 --> 34:50.690
Master Xie.

34:50.920 --> 34:52.050
Why is Xie Qidao not here?

34:52.510 --> 34:54.340
Someone needs to guard the main hall of Blood River.

34:55.000 --> 34:56.130
Uncle Qidao is both respected

34:56.320 --> 34:57.380
and decisive.

34:57.710 --> 34:58.570
He'll stay there

34:59.110 --> 35:00.650
to act as Patriarch.

35:02.230 --> 35:03.210
Where is Prince of Langya?

35:06.480 --> 35:07.740
You seem impatient, Master Su.

35:08.590 --> 35:09.420
If we don't start soon,

35:10.360 --> 35:11.690
the food will go cold.

35:17.760 --> 35:19.170
Let me offer you all a toast.

35:19.800 --> 35:21.420
His Highness didn't mean to be late.

35:21.710 --> 35:23.570
Something urgent just came up.

35:32.360 --> 35:33.460
If it's that urgent,

35:34.320 --> 35:36.300
it must concern the fate of the world.

35:37.030 --> 35:38.090
Then let's wait for him.

35:40.280 --> 35:40.900
Indeed.

35:42.070 --> 35:43.940
I'm sure it's not some romantic affair.

35:44.710 --> 35:45.420
It's understandable.

35:46.030 --> 35:46.610
Please.

35:55.800 --> 35:57.300
They're already at Fengxue Tower.

35:57.630 --> 35:58.900
Yet Prince of Langya hasn't shown up.

35:59.030 --> 35:59.610
Correct.

36:00.230 --> 36:00.940
It seems like Prince of Langya

36:01.000 --> 36:02.130
doesn't intend to cooperate with them.

36:02.800 --> 36:03.380
Wait a little longer.

36:03.550 --> 36:04.010
Yes, sir.

36:06.960 --> 36:07.460
Report, General.

36:07.630 --> 36:08.490
The First Prince's guests

36:08.510 --> 36:09.690
are entering Tianqi City.

36:09.800 --> 36:11.130
One of them are already at the manor.

36:12.440 --> 36:13.050
Who is it?

36:15.630 --> 36:16.460
General Dian.

36:18.000 --> 36:19.050
It's been a while.

36:20.440 --> 36:21.780
The Blade Ghost of Nanjue?

36:22.670 --> 36:23.340
Why?

36:23.340 --> 36:24.070
[Xu Liuyun, Blade Ghost of Nanjue ]

36:24.070 --> 36:24.900
I'm not welcome here?

36:25.590 --> 36:27.260
Mr. Xu, since you came all the way here,

36:28.480 --> 36:29.210
you deserve

36:30.000 --> 36:30.980
a cup of tea.

36:37.360 --> 36:38.170
Why invite him?

36:39.710 --> 36:40.740
Mr. Xu

36:41.280 --> 36:42.650
is always into the way of martial arts.

36:43.320 --> 36:45.530
He's longed to witness the Heaven-Splitting Blade Technique.

36:46.960 --> 36:48.090
I invited him here

36:48.510 --> 36:50.210
simply out of appreciation for his talent.

36:51.440 --> 36:52.650
There are no boundaries between nations.

36:54.510 --> 36:55.380
Just like how I admire

36:55.480 --> 36:57.300
Ms Night Crow's medical skills.

36:58.030 --> 36:59.260
The Heaven-Splitting Blade Technique

36:59.320 --> 37:01.690
was kept by Mr. Li of the Academy.

37:02.030 --> 37:02.780
He then gifted it

37:02.960 --> 37:04.340
to Xiao Ruofeng,

37:04.400 --> 37:05.260
who was the Ninth Prince then.

37:05.920 --> 37:07.380
When this is over,

37:08.550 --> 37:10.090
Prince of Langya's treasures

37:10.920 --> 37:12.570
will be mine.

37:13.150 --> 37:13.740
Uncle Ye.

37:14.670 --> 37:15.570
Don't just stand there.

37:27.440 --> 37:28.260
Looks like Prince of Langya

37:28.280 --> 37:29.260
has made up his mind.

37:30.360 --> 37:31.170
If so, Muyu...

37:34.510 --> 37:35.170
Let's go.

37:36.920 --> 37:37.530
Miss Bai.

37:38.230 --> 37:39.130
Looks like we won't have time

37:39.150 --> 37:40.900
to make He-Yu Clinic famous in Tianqi.

37:41.400 --> 37:42.260
We're leaving tomorrow.

37:42.840 --> 37:43.420
Come.

37:45.480 --> 37:46.010
You can't go.

37:51.590 --> 37:52.260
Why?

37:52.440 --> 37:53.340
Are you

37:53.360 --> 37:54.260
going to take credit

37:54.360 --> 37:55.530
for capturing us?

37:55.840 --> 37:56.420
Tell me

37:56.440 --> 37:57.690
how to undo the puppet spell.

37:59.110 --> 38:00.210
I have to save my senior brother.

38:01.150 --> 38:01.650
Lianyue.

38:02.630 --> 38:03.380
Calm yourself.

38:06.960 --> 38:07.570
Everyone.

38:08.150 --> 38:08.780
We indeed

38:09.360 --> 38:10.530
have a favor to ask of you.

38:11.360 --> 38:12.650
Right now, the only one who can save Tang Linghuang

38:12.840 --> 38:14.260
is Physician Bai from Medicine King Valley.

38:15.320 --> 38:16.530
We're being sincere here.

38:18.710 --> 38:19.610
You expect us to help just like that?

38:21.110 --> 38:22.860
We already helped your clan once.

38:23.550 --> 38:25.260
Yet your clan

38:25.360 --> 38:26.570
is more corrupt

38:26.590 --> 38:27.570
than any heretical sect.

38:28.230 --> 38:29.090
Whether Tang Linghuang lives or dies,

38:29.150 --> 38:30.340
what's it to us?

38:30.710 --> 38:31.340
Move aside!

38:31.920 --> 38:32.380
Stop!

38:49.630 --> 38:51.530
So this is Blood River's ultimate art,

38:51.550 --> 38:52.340
the Hell Palm.

38:53.000 --> 38:53.530
It's certainly

38:53.800 --> 38:54.740
extraordinary.

38:57.000 --> 38:58.420
Your Highness, you're late.

39:02.360 --> 39:04.130
What great state affair

39:04.150 --> 39:04.900
kept you so long?

39:06.000 --> 39:07.090
If you had told us about it,

39:07.360 --> 39:09.010
we wouldn't have waited this long.

39:09.760 --> 39:10.820
We would've left anyway.

39:12.400 --> 39:13.690
It wasn't some state affair.

39:14.440 --> 39:15.420
Just a matter

39:15.840 --> 39:17.010
of the heart.

39:21.280 --> 39:22.300
Then it was worth waiting for.

39:22.760 --> 39:23.570
It was worth it.

39:29.190 --> 39:29.820
Miss Bai,

39:30.360 --> 39:30.980
what's wrong?

39:32.440 --> 39:33.090
Nothing.

39:34.280 --> 39:35.210
Your Highness,

39:35.320 --> 39:36.900
you seem a bit tired.

39:37.070 --> 39:38.010
Shall I write a prescription

39:38.110 --> 39:39.420
to help regulate your health?

39:40.150 --> 39:41.010
Thank you, Miss Bai.

39:41.550 --> 39:42.210
But there's no need for that.

39:44.840 --> 39:45.530
Everyone,

39:46.070 --> 39:46.650
please.

39:55.360 --> 39:56.530
So, friends of the Blood River,

39:57.150 --> 39:58.490
what is it you wish to discuss with us?

39:59.360 --> 40:00.260
Since Changhe

40:00.280 --> 40:01.380
took over as our patriarch,

40:01.840 --> 40:02.980
we've reorganized the Three Families,

40:03.110 --> 40:03.980
leveled the Soul Reapers' Hall,

40:04.360 --> 40:05.420
and cut off

40:05.480 --> 40:06.380
Shadow Sect's interference.

40:06.800 --> 40:07.650
Now, we're

40:08.360 --> 40:10.210
a purely martial sect.

40:10.710 --> 40:12.050
But after all those years,

40:12.360 --> 40:13.090
we left the world

40:13.150 --> 40:14.570
with too dark a legacy.

40:15.030 --> 40:16.570
It's not easy to step out

40:16.630 --> 40:17.380
of the shadows.

40:19.230 --> 40:20.940
We had planned to work with the Tang Clan,

40:21.920 --> 40:23.570
using their reputation

40:24.280 --> 40:26.170
to clear obstacles for us.

40:26.510 --> 40:27.210
We had already

40:27.230 --> 40:28.380
reached an agreement with Tang Linghuang.

40:28.710 --> 40:30.210
However, the Tang Clan fell into corruption.

40:30.800 --> 40:32.090
Tang Lingzun led a revolt

40:32.150 --> 40:33.170
and ruined our plan.

40:33.440 --> 40:35.050
We helped them for nothing.

40:35.400 --> 40:36.010
Your Highness.

40:37.000 --> 40:38.420
Tell me, who's the righteous one

40:39.400 --> 40:40.490
and who's the evil one here?

40:44.550 --> 40:45.210
Well,

40:45.590 --> 40:46.820
why didn't you go to Xueyue City?

40:47.510 --> 40:49.420
It's the top sect

40:49.880 --> 40:50.490
in the martial world today.

40:52.230 --> 40:53.210
Your Highness is insightful.

40:54.190 --> 40:55.010
If you ask me,

40:55.480 --> 40:57.340
we should just challenge them.

40:58.000 --> 40:59.050
Beat their three city lords

40:59.110 --> 41:00.210
to a pulp.

41:00.760 --> 41:01.420
After that,

41:01.960 --> 41:02.940
who'd care

41:02.960 --> 41:03.820
what the world thinks?

41:04.190 --> 41:05.570
We'd be number one!

41:07.800 --> 41:09.650
Who are you planning to beat to a pulp?

41:13.550 --> 41:14.090
Changhe.

41:14.510 --> 41:15.300
Stop talking.

41:17.400 --> 41:17.900
Fine.

41:18.590 --> 41:19.260
Go on.

41:20.400 --> 41:21.260
We

41:21.760 --> 41:23.130
were born

41:23.590 --> 41:25.610
as swords in others' hands.

41:26.670 --> 41:27.490
But now we refuse

41:28.510 --> 41:30.380
to be anyone's pawn.

41:31.360 --> 41:32.340
Thus, Xueyue City

41:33.800 --> 41:35.300
isn't the right choice.

41:36.590 --> 41:37.170
So

41:37.670 --> 41:38.900
you ended up

41:39.960 --> 41:40.610
choosing me.

41:43.150 --> 41:44.690
You're the foremost warrior of Beili

41:45.630 --> 41:46.530
and the top man in court.

41:47.480 --> 41:48.820
Your brilliance

41:49.710 --> 41:50.610
is enough

41:51.440 --> 41:52.300
to light our path forward.

41:54.070 --> 41:55.530
You wish to use His Highness' name

41:56.110 --> 41:57.860
to gain recognition for the Blood River?

42:00.480 --> 42:01.340
You could say so.

42:02.360 --> 42:03.570
It's

42:04.670 --> 42:05.610
a win-win situation.

42:06.440 --> 42:07.690
We'll rescue Tang Linghuang,

42:08.440 --> 42:10.170
get rid of the the puppet poison in his body,

42:10.590 --> 42:11.900
and eliminate Night Crow.

42:13.280 --> 42:14.740
As for the one behind her,

42:16.280 --> 42:17.690
they're likely of the imperial line.

42:18.400 --> 42:19.490
We'll help Your Highness

42:20.070 --> 42:21.900
wipe their power from the realm.

42:23.510 --> 42:24.780
That's our offer.

42:27.440 --> 42:28.690
We wonder

42:29.590 --> 42:30.530
if it's enough for you.

42:35.660 --> 42:39.140
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

42:39.180 --> 42:43.060
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

42:44.900 --> 42:48.380
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

42:48.420 --> 42:52.260
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

42:54.260 --> 42:57.540
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

42:57.660 --> 42:59.740
♪Still I can't let go♪

42:59.900 --> 43:03.340
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

43:03.820 --> 43:06.020
♪My heart no longer my own♪

43:06.140 --> 43:11.140
♪No one can escape from love♪

43:27.740 --> 43:31.460
♪How many hidden feelings♪

43:31.580 --> 43:35.660
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

43:36.900 --> 43:40.780
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

43:40.900 --> 43:45.140
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

43:46.260 --> 43:49.140
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

43:49.220 --> 43:53.460
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

43:55.740 --> 43:59.740
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

43:59.780 --> 44:03.220
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

44:04.740 --> 44:08.180
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

44:08.260 --> 44:12.060
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

44:13.980 --> 44:17.420
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

